              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Qab-Ser 22.12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Waan atini gumi Israelitini jettu: Handaara humbi woya teesaniti tolfad'a, ammalle museensa bule handaara suni ch'ufati naqa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waan kana bara ch'ufa tolchu maltani. Handaari kunini beesisa isanii taha, aka hojja isa agartani ch'ufa seera kiyya qaabatani guutani; yo akasi tatani, nara gortani fed'ifi d'araa teesani gula imbanne. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Handaari sunini seera kiyya ch'ufa isani qaabsise, isani nama kiyya qulqullo tatani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anini AABBO Waaqa keesani, ka lafa Misiri keesaa isani baase Waaqa keesani tahe. Anini AABBO, Waaqa keesani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.41"
            ]
          }
